    },
    "脚本 URL" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Script URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "脚本会按此优先级请求音源 URL,若该音质不可用,会自动降级。开启「用专辑栏显示歌词」后,CarPlay 和锁屏原本显示专辑名的位置,会随播放进度显示当前歌词(参考 QQ / 网易云);无歌词时仍显示专辑名" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripts request source URLs in this priority order; if a quality level is unavailable, it falls back automatically. When “Show lyrics in the album field” is on, the spot that normally shows the album name on CarPlay and the Lock Screen shows the current lyric line as playback progresses (like QQ Music / NetEase Cloud Music); the album name is still shown when no lyrics are available."
          }
